# CLIo logo - Neon
# Hollow letters bent from rounded box-drawing lines, like neon tubes.
# In --ascii the curves become + - | and it still reads as an outline. 34x5.
@palette
a=#ff5fd2 b
b=#45f3ff b
c=#ff5fd2
d=#45f3ff
@effect flicker
@art
╭──────╮ ╭─╮      ╭─────╮
│ ╭────╯ │ │      ╰─╮ ╭─╯ ╭──────╮
│ │      │ │        │ │   │ ╭──╮ │
│ ╰────╮ │ ╰────╮ ╭─╯ ╰─╮ │ ╰──╯ │
╰──────╯ ╰──────╯ ╰─────╯ ╰──────╯
@mask
aaaaaaaa aaa      aaaaaaa
a aaaaaa a a      aaa aaa bbbbbbbb
a a      a a        a a   b bbbb b
a aaaaaa a aaaaaa aaa aaa b bbbb b
aaaaaaaa aaaaaaaa aaaaaaa bbbbbbbb
@small
╭─╴╷  ╶┬╴ ╭╮
╰─╴╰─╴╶┴╴ ╰╯
@mask
cccc  ccc dd
ccccccccc dd
